Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8150-xiaomi-nabu: enable SLPI

Use the SLPI image already present in panpanpanpan/nabu-firmware at ref 1.
The SoC include already describes the SLPI transport, context banks and
interrupts; the board already reserves its firmware memory.

Candidate for both v6.17.0-sm8150 and the repository's patched v7.2.6.
Requires packaging slpi_nb.mbn and the HexagonFS sensor registry separately.
Hardware validation on nabu is still required.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts
@@ -781,6 +781,11 @@
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8150/xiaomi/nabu/cdsp.mbn";
 };
 
+&remoteproc_slpi {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8150/xiaomi/nabu/slpi_nb.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &remoteproc_mpss {
 	status = "okay";
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8150/xiaomi/nabu/modem.mbn";
